 ("Describe the generalised DDD variant.", ["Reticulate pigmentation extends beyond flexures to trunk and limbs, with hypopigmented macules in some — overlaps with dyschromatosis universalis"]),
 ("What genetic counselling applies?", ["Autosomal dominant with variable expressivity — 50% transmission; examine relatives (often undiagnosed mild cases)"]),
